# Keep the handoff notes current

`PROJECT_NOTES.md` is the handoff for the next agent. After any change to this project — code, n8n workflow, Vercel, credentials, knowledge, or review behavior — update that file in the same turn, before the final reply.

- Record what changed, the date, and the live state a new agent would otherwise get wrong.
- Do not write secrets, API keys, client secrets, or webhook values.
- If a change is live in n8n or Vercel but not committed, say so.
- Replace outdated statements. Do not leave an old rule next to the new one.
